antipattern : cramped-padding
name        : Cramped padding
description : Text is too close to the edge of its container. Two shapes: (1) an element with its own text where the 
              padding is too low for the font size, and (2) a wrapper with text-bearing children and near-zero padding 
              against a visible boundary (border, outline, or non-transparent background) ÔÇö children land flush 
              against the boundary line. Add at least 8px (ideally 12ÔÇô16px) of padding inside bordered, outlined, or 
              colored containers.
